# Create a new App Password in your Google Account:
# 1. Go to your Google Account management.
# 2. Search for "App passwords" (Security > 2-Step Verification).
# 3. Select 'Mail' and 'Other' (name it Portfolio).
# 4. Copy the generated 16-character password and paste it below.

PORT=3000
